---
/**
 * Every route in src/pages/ is a real, statically-generated page — this
 * file becomes "/" at build time as plain HTML, with zero client-side
 * JavaScript shipped (nothing here uses a `client:*` directive, and
 * nothing needs to: it's all static content).
 */
